{"id":"e76decda1c13805a","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-soundness.md","title":"Soundness","display":"df-soundness — Soundness","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-soundness","aliases":["92-df-soundness"],"display":"df-soundness — Soundness","depends_on":["[[92-df-theory]]","[[92-df-true-arithmetic]]"],"source":"本地算术结构的 Tarski 语义；对照原书第 II 章 pp.18–19 的指定解释；任意结构版本是本地展开","source_status":"原书解释概念的本地语义扩展"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-soundness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-soundness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-soundness — Soundness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"87dbd27955ecb3b6\" href=\"?note=87dbd27955ecb3b6\" title=\"92-df-theory\">92-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d782096c679079e3\" href=\"?note=d782096c679079e3\" title=\"92-df-true-arithmetic\">92-df-true-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地算术结构的 Tarski 语义；对照原书第 II 章 pp.18–19 的指定解释；任意结构版本是本地展开"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书解释概念的本地语义扩展"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}_G\\)</span> (theory parameter and predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"87dbd27955ecb3b6\" href=\"?note=87dbd27955ecb3b6\" title=\"92-df-theory\">92-df-theory</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TA}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{TA}_G\\)</span> (true arithmetic, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d782096c679079e3\" href=\"?note=d782096c679079e3\" title=\"92-df-true-arithmetic\">92-df-true-arithmetic</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ArithSound}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{ArithSound}_G\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}soundness} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ArithSound}_G(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)\\land T\\subseteq\\mathrm{TA}_G\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}soundness} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ArithSound}_G(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)\\land T\\subseteq\\mathrm{TA}_G\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>可靠性：所有定理都是真的</li>\n<li>因为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>在本文件中已经是闭合的定理集，准确条件是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in T\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)\">\\(\\varphi\\in T\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)\\)</span>；无需再引入未定义的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\varphi\">\\(T\\vdash\\varphi\\)</span></li>\n<li>这是关于全部算术句的可靠性，强于只限制某个复杂度类的部分可靠性</li>\n<li>可靠<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow\">\\(\\Rightarrow\\)</span> <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Rightarrow\">\\(\\Rightarrow\\)</span>一致</li>\n<li>由Tarski不可定义性，完整算术可靠性不能简单压缩成<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>自身语言中的单一全局真理句；有限层反射模式或部分可靠性仍可表达</li>\n<li>“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>-可靠性”与“1-一致性”的等同依赖所采用的1-一致性约定及足够弱基理论，使用时应声明约定</li>\n<li>在能构造标准自然数结构的通常元理论中，可由PA各公理在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N_G\">\\(\\mathfrak N_G\\)</span>中为真且规则保真证明PA的外部可靠性；这不是PA内部对自身可靠性的证明</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"87dbd27955ecb3b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-true-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"d782096c679079e3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-true-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"87dbd27955ecb3b6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ and $\\mathrm{Theory}_G$ (theory parameter and predicate, see [[92-df-theory]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-true-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"d782096c679079e3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TA}_G$ (true arithmetic, see [[92-df-true-arithmetic]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Theory}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TA}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ArithSound}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}soundness} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ArithSound}_G(T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)\\land T\\subseteq\\mathrm{TA}_G","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in T\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ArithTrue}_G(\\varphi)","display":false},{"tex":"T\\vdash\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\Rightarrow","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N_G","display":false}],"bytes":1748,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-190","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-soundness]]"}],"outgoing":["87dbd27955ecb3b6","d782096c679079e3"]}